    narr:narration """On 20260718, QuintonFairweather announced [the adoption decision](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) for Zypherion as the analytics pipeline tool, grounding it in [a concrete performance claim](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) of 15x faster columnar queries against the current setup, and [a near-term migration start](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) set for next quarter. The session then restated these three points as settled bullets: [Zypherion as the database choice](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), [the 15x columnar-query improvement](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5), and [Q3 2026 as the migration start](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6). The hub covers tool selection, a specific performance benchmark, and a migration timeline — all dated to the same session. It does not cover vendor evaluation alternatives, cost analysis, rollback planning, or anything outside the Zypherion analytics adoption.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2> ;
